Package: MycoHalo
Title: Quantification of Fungal Melanization and Interaction Halos
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Mitra",
      family = "Ghotbi",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "mitra.ghotbir@gemail.com"
    )
Description:
    Tools for automated analysis of fungal colony images,
    including colony segmentation, melanization quantification,
    radial pigmentation profiling, halo detection, and
    microbial confrontation assays. The package provides
    reproducible workflows for measuring grayscale intensity,
    melanization indices, spatial pigmentation gradients,
    and interaction-associated phenotypes from digital images.
